    "html": "<p>A cell of electromotive force (emf) <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span> and negligible internal resistance is connected across a load of resistance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. The energy dissipated in the load in a time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the energy dissipated in a time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2t\"></span> by a load of resistance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2R\"></span> when it is connected across a cell of emf <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2V\"></span> ?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"W\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2W\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4W\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8W\"></span></p></li></ol>"
